"this is of the form '2003-07-08 16:49:45,896' (the numbers after the comma "
"are millisecond portion of the time)."
msgstr ""
"人類可讀的 :class:`LogRecord` 建立時間。預設格式為 '2003-07-08 "
"16:49:45,896'（逗號後的數字是時間的毫秒部分）。"

