#: ../../library/logging.rst:1081
msgid "LoggerAdapter Objects"
msgstr "LoggerAdapter 物件"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1083
msgid ""
":class:`LoggerAdapter` instances are used to conveniently pass contextual "
"information into logging calls. For a usage example, see the section "
"on :ref:`adding contextual information to your logging output <context-"
"info>`."
msgstr ""
":class:`LoggerAdapter` 實例用於方便地將情境資訊傳入日誌記錄呼叫中。使用範例請"
"參閱\\ :ref:`在日誌輸出中加入情境資訊 <context-info>`\\ 一節。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1089
msgid ""
"Returns an instance of :class:`LoggerAdapter` initialized with an "
"underlying :class:`Logger` instance, an optional dict-like object (*extra*), "
"and an optional boolean (*merge_extra*) indicating whether or not the "
"*extra* argument of individual log calls should be merged with "
"the :class:`LoggerAdapter` extra. The default behavior is to ignore the "
"*extra* argument of individual log calls and only use the one of "
"the :class:`LoggerAdapter` instance"
msgstr ""
"回傳一個 :class:`LoggerAdapter` 實例，以底層的 :class:`Logger` 實例、一個可選"
"的類字典物件 (*extra*)，以及一個可選的布林值 (*merge_extra*) 初始化；"
"*merge_extra* 表示是否要將個別日誌呼叫的 *extra* 引數"
"與 :class:`LoggerAdapter` 的 extra 合併。預設行為是忽略個別日誌呼叫的 "
"*extra* 引數，只使用 :class:`LoggerAdapter` 實例的 extra"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1099
msgid ""
"Modifies the message and/or keyword arguments passed to a logging call in "
"order to insert contextual information. This implementation takes the object "
"passed as *extra* to the constructor and adds it to *kwargs* using key "
"'extra'. The return value is a (*msg*, *kwargs*) tuple which has the "
"(possibly modified) versions of the arguments passed in."
msgstr ""
"修改傳給日誌記錄呼叫的訊息和／或關鍵字引數，以插入情境資訊。此實作會取得傳給"
"建構函式的 *extra* 物件，並以鍵 'extra' 將其加入 *kwargs*。回傳值是一個 "
"(*msg*, *kwargs*) 元組，包含傳入引數（可能已修改）的版本。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1107
msgid "Delegates to the underlying :attr:`!manager` on *logger*."
msgstr "委派給 *logger* 上的底層 :attr:`!manager`。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1111
msgid "Delegates to the underlying :meth:`!_log` method on *logger*."
msgstr "委派給 *logger* 上的底層 :meth:`!_log` 方法。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1113
msgid ""
"In addition to the above, :class:`LoggerAdapter` supports the following "
"methods "
"of :class:`Logger`: :meth:`~Logger.debug`, :meth:`~Logger.info`, :meth:`~Logger.warning`, :meth:`~Logger.error`, :meth:`~Logger.exception`, :meth:`~Logger.critical`, :meth:`~Logger.log`, :meth:`~Logger.isEnabledFor`, :meth:`~Logger.getEffectiveLevel`, :meth:`~Logger.setLevel` "
"and :meth:`~Logger.hasHandlers`. These methods have the same signatures as "
"their counterparts in :class:`Logger`, so you can use the two types of "
"instances interchangeably."
msgstr ""
"除了上述內容之外，:class:`LoggerAdapter` 還支援 :class:`Logger` 的下列方"
"法：:meth:`~Logger.debug`、:meth:`~Logger.info`、:meth:`~Logger.warning`、:meth:`~Logger.error`、:meth:`~Logger.exception`、:meth:`~Logger.critical`、:meth:`~Logger.log`、:meth:`~Logger.isEnabledFor`、:meth:`~Logger.getEffectiveLevel`、:meth:`~Logger.setLevel` "
"和 :meth:`~Logger.hasHandlers`。這些方法的簽名與 :class:`Logger` 中對應的方法"
"相同，因此你可以交替使用這兩種實例。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1124
msgid ""
"The :meth:`~Logger.isEnabledFor`, :meth:`~Logger.getEffectiveLevel`, :meth:`~Logger.setLevel` "
"and :meth:`~Logger.hasHandlers` methods were added "
"to :class:`LoggerAdapter`.  These methods delegate to the underlying logger."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~Logger.isEnabledFor`、:meth:`~Logger.getEffectiveLevel`、:meth:`~Logger.setLevel` "
"和 :meth:`~Logger.hasHandlers` 方法已新增至 :class:`LoggerAdapter`。這些方法"
"會委派給底層的記錄器。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1130
msgid ""
"Attribute :attr:`!manager` and method :meth:`!_log` were added, which "
"delegate to the underlying logger and allow adapters to be nested."
msgstr ""
"新增了屬性 :attr:`!manager` 和方法 :meth:`!_log`，它們會委派給底層的記錄器，"
"並讓 adapter 可以巢狀使用。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1135
msgid "The *extra* argument is now optional."
msgstr "*extra* 引數現在是可選的。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1139
msgid "The *merge_extra* parameter was added."
msgstr "新增 *merge_extra* 參數。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1143
msgid "Thread Safety"
msgstr "執行緒安全"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1145
msgid ""
"The logging module is intended to be thread-safe without any special work "
"needing to be done by its clients. It achieves this through using threading "
"locks; there is one lock to serialize access to the module's shared data, "
"and each handler also creates a lock to serialize access to its underlying I/"
"O."
msgstr ""
"logging 模組的設計是執行緒安全的，使用它的程式碼不需要做任何特別的處理。它是"
"透過使用執行緒鎖來達成這點：有一個鎖用來讓對模組共享資料的存取依序進行，而每"
"個處理器也會建立一個鎖，讓對其底層 I/O 的存取依序進行。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1150
msgid ""
"If you are implementing asynchronous signal handlers using the :mod:`signal` "
"module, you may not be able to use logging from within such handlers. This "
"is because lock implementations in the :mod:`threading` module are not "
"always re-entrant, and so cannot be invoked from such signal handlers."
msgstr ""
"如果你正在使用 :mod:`signal` 模組實作非同步訊號處理程式，可能無法在這類處理程"
"式中使用 logging。這是因為 :mod:`threading` 模組中的鎖實作並不一定是可重入的 "
"(re-entrant)，因此無法從這類訊號處理程式中叫用。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1157
msgid "Module-Level Functions"
msgstr "模組層級函式"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1159
msgid ""
"In addition to the classes described above, there are a number of module-"
"level functions."
msgstr "除了上述的類別之外，還有一些模組層級的函式。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1165
msgid ""
"Return a logger with the specified name or, if name is ``None``, return the "
"root logger of the hierarchy. If specified, the name is typically a dot-"
"separated hierarchical name like *'a'*, *'a.b'* or *'a.b.c.d'*. Choice of "
"these names is entirely up to the developer who is using logging, though it "
"is recommended that ``__name__`` be used unless you have a specific reason "
"for not doing that, as mentioned in :ref:`logger`."
msgstr ""
"回傳具有指定名稱的記錄器；若 name 為 ``None``，則回傳階層中的根記錄器。若有指"
"定，名稱通常是以點分隔的階層式名稱，例如 *'a'*、*'a.b'* 或 *'a.b.c.d'*。這些"
"名稱完全由使用 logging 的開發者決定，不過除非有特定理由不這樣做，否則建議使"
"用 ``__name__``\\ （參見 :ref:`logger`）。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1172
msgid ""
"All calls to this function with a given name return the same logger "
"instance. This means that logger instances never need to be passed between "
"different parts of an application."
msgstr ""
"以相同名稱呼叫此函式，一律會回傳同一個記錄器實例。這表示記錄器實例永遠不需要"
"在應用程式的不同部分之間傳遞。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1179
msgid ""
"Return either the standard :class:`Logger` class, or the last class passed "
"to :func:`setLoggerClass`. This function may be called from within a new "
"class definition, to ensure that installing a customized :class:`Logger` "
"class will not undo customizations already applied by other code. For "
"example::"
msgstr ""
"回傳標準的 :class:`Logger` 類別，或是最後一次傳給 :func:`setLoggerClass` 的類"
"別。可以在新的類別定義中呼叫此函式，以確保安裝自訂的 :class:`Logger` 類別時，"
"不會抵銷其他程式碼已套用的自訂內容。例如： ::"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1184
msgid ""
"class MyLogger(logging.getLoggerClass()):\n"
"    # ... override behaviour here"
msgstr ""
"class MyLogger(logging.getLoggerClass()):\n"
"    # ... 在這裡覆蓋其行為"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1190
msgid "Return a callable which is used to create a :class:`LogRecord`."
msgstr "回傳一個用來建立 :class:`LogRecord` 的可呼叫物件。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1192
msgid ""
"This function has been provided, along with :func:`setLogRecordFactory`, to "
"allow developers more control over how the :class:`LogRecord` representing a "
"logging event is constructed."
msgstr ""
"提供此函式（以及 :func:`setLogRecordFactory`）是為了讓開發者能更進一步控制代"
"表日誌事件的 :class:`LogRecord` 是如何被建構的。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1197
msgid ""
"See :func:`setLogRecordFactory` for more information about the how the "
"factory is called."
msgstr "關於工廠如何被呼叫的更多資訊，請參閱 :func:`setLogRecordFactory`。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1202
msgid ""
"This is a convenience function that calls :meth:`Logger.debug`, on the root "
"logger. The handling of the arguments is in every way identical to what is "
"described in that method."
msgstr ""
"這是一個便利函式，會在根記錄器上呼叫 :meth:`Logger.debug`。引數的處理方式與該"
"方法中所描述的完全相同。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1206
msgid ""
"The only difference is that if the root logger has no handlers, "
"then :func:`basicConfig` is called, prior to calling ``debug`` on the root "
"logger."
msgstr ""
"唯一的差別是，如果根記錄器沒有處理器，就會在對根記錄器呼叫 ``debug`` 之前先呼"
"叫 :func:`basicConfig`。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1209
msgid ""
"For very short scripts or quick demonstrations of ``logging`` facilities, "
"``debug`` and the other module-level functions may be convenient. However, "
"most programs will want to carefully and explicitly control the logging "
"configuration, and should therefore prefer creating a module-level logger "
"and calling :meth:`Logger.debug` (or other level-specific methods) on it, as "
"described at the beginning of this documentation."
msgstr ""
"對於非常短的腳本或 ``logging`` 功能的快速示範，``debug`` 和其他模組層級函式可"
"能很方便。然而，大多數程式都會想要仔細且明確地控制日誌設定，因此應優先建立模"
"組層級的記錄器，並在其上呼叫 :meth:`Logger.debug`\\ （或其他特定等級的方"
"法），如本文件開頭所述。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1219
msgid ""
"Logs a message with level :const:`INFO` on the root logger. The arguments "
"and behavior are otherwise the same as for :func:`debug`."
msgstr ""
"在根記錄器上記錄一則等級為 :const:`INFO` 的訊息。其餘引數與行為皆"
"與 :func:`debug` 相同。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1225
msgid ""
"Logs a message with level :const:`WARNING` on the root logger. The arguments "
"and behavior are otherwise the same as for :func:`debug`."
msgstr ""
"在根記錄器上記錄一則等級為 :const:`WARNING` 的訊息。其餘引數與行為皆"
"與 :func:`debug` 相同。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1228
msgid ""
"There is an obsolete function ``warn`` which is functionally identical to "
"``warning``. As ``warn`` is deprecated, please do not use it - use "
"``warning`` instead."
msgstr ""
"有一個已過時的函式 ``warn``，其功能與 ``warning`` 完全相同。由於 ``warn`` 已"
"被棄用，請不要使用它，請改用 ``warning``。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1235
msgid ""
"Logs a message with level :const:`ERROR` on the root logger. The arguments "
"and behavior are otherwise the same as for :func:`debug`."
msgstr ""
"在根記錄器上記錄一則等級為 :const:`ERROR` 的訊息。其餘引數與行為皆"
"與 :func:`debug` 相同。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1241
msgid ""
"Logs a message with level :const:`CRITICAL` on the root logger. The "
"arguments and behavior are otherwise the same as for :func:`debug`."
msgstr ""
"在根記錄器上記錄一則等級為 :const:`CRITICAL` 的訊息。其餘引數與行為皆"
"與 :func:`debug` 相同。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1247
msgid ""
"Logs a message with level :const:`ERROR` on the root logger. The arguments "
"and behavior are otherwise the same as for :func:`debug`. Exception info is "
"added to the logging message. This function should only be called from an "
"exception handler."
msgstr ""
"在根記錄器上記錄一則等級為 :const:`ERROR` 的訊息。其餘引數與行為皆"
"與 :func:`debug` 相同。例外資訊會被加入日誌訊息中。此函式只應從例外處理程式中"
"呼叫。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1253
msgid ""
"Logs a message with level *level* on the root logger. The arguments and "
"behavior are otherwise the same as for :func:`debug`."
msgstr ""
"在根記錄器上記錄一則等級為 *level* 的訊息。其餘引數與行為皆與 :func:`debug` "
"相同。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1258
msgid ""
"Provides an overriding level *level* for all loggers which takes precedence "
"over the logger's own level. When the need arises to temporarily throttle "
"logging output down across the whole application, this function can be "
"useful. Its effect is to disable all logging calls of severity *level* and "
"below, so that if you call it with a value of INFO, then all INFO and DEBUG "
"events would be discarded, whereas those of severity WARNING and above would "
"be processed according to the logger's effective level. If "
"``logging.disable(logging.NOTSET)`` is called, it effectively removes this "
"overriding level, so that logging output again depends on the effective "
"levels of individual loggers."
msgstr ""
"為所有記錄器提供一個優先於記錄器自身等級的覆蓋等級 *level*。當需要暫時降低整"
"個應用程式的日誌輸出量時，此函式會很有用。它的效果是停用所有嚴重性為 *level* "
"及以下的日誌記錄呼叫，因此如果你以 INFO 值呼叫它，則所有 INFO 和 DEBUG 事件都"
"會被捨棄，而嚴重性為 WARNING 及以上的事件則會依照記錄器的有效等級來處理。如果"
"呼叫了 ``logging.disable(logging.NOTSET)``，實際上就會移除這個覆蓋等級，讓日"
"誌輸出再次取決於個別記錄器的有效等級。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1269
msgid ""
"Note that if you have defined any custom logging level higher than "
"``CRITICAL`` (this is not recommended), you won't be able to rely on the "
"default value for the *level* parameter, but will have to explicitly supply "
"a suitable value."
msgstr ""
"請注意，如果你定義了任何高於 ``CRITICAL`` 的自訂日誌等級（不建議這麼做），就"
"無法依賴 *level* 參數的預設值，而必須明確提供適當的值。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1274
msgid ""
"The *level* parameter was defaulted to level ``CRITICAL``. "
"See :issue:`28524` for more information about this change."
msgstr ""
"*level* 參數的預設值改為等級 ``CRITICAL``。關於此變更的更多資訊，請參"
"閱 :issue:`28524`。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1280
msgid ""
"Associates level *level* with text *levelName* in an internal dictionary, "
"which is used to map numeric levels to a textual representation, for example "
"when a :class:`Formatter` formats a message. This function can also be used "
"to define your own levels. The only constraints are that all levels used "
"must be registered using this function, levels should be positive integers "
"and they should increase in increasing order of severity."
msgstr ""
"在一個內部字典中將等級 *level* 與文字 *levelName* 關聯起來，該字典用於將數值"
"等級對映到文字表示，例如在 :class:`Formatter` 格式化訊息時。此函式也可以用來"
"定義你自己的等級。唯一的限制是，所有使用到的等級都必須透過此函式註冊，等級應"
"為正整數，而且應隨著嚴重性遞增而遞增。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1287
msgid ""
"If you are thinking of defining your own levels, please see the section "
"on :ref:`custom-levels`."
msgstr "如果你打算定義自己的等級，請參閱\\ :ref:`custom-levels`\\ 一節。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1292
msgid ""
"Returns a mapping from level names to their corresponding logging levels. "
"For example, the string \"CRITICAL\" maps to :const:`CRITICAL`. The returned "
"mapping is copied from an internal mapping on each call to this function."
msgstr ""
"回傳從等級名稱到其對應日誌等級的對映。例如，字串 \"CRITICAL\" 對映"
"到 :const:`CRITICAL`。每次呼叫此函式時，回傳的對映都是從內部對映複製而來的。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1300
msgid "Returns the textual or numeric representation of logging level *level*."
msgstr "回傳日誌等級 *level* 的文字或數值表示。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1302
msgid ""
"If *level* is one of the predefined "
"levels :const:`CRITICAL`, :const:`ERROR`, :const:`WARNING`, :const:`INFO` "
"or :const:`DEBUG` then you get the corresponding string. If you have "
"associated levels with names using :func:`addLevelName` then the name you "
"have associated with *level* is returned. If a numeric value corresponding "
"to one of the defined levels is passed in, the corresponding string "
"representation is returned."
msgstr ""
"如果 *level* 是預定義等"
"級 :const:`CRITICAL`、:const:`ERROR`、:const:`WARNING`、:const:`INFO` "
"或 :const:`DEBUG` 其中之一，你會得到對應的字串。如果你已使"
"用 :func:`addLevelName` 將等級與名稱關聯，則會回傳你與 *level* 關聯的名稱。如"
"果傳入的是對應於某個已定義等級的數值，則會回傳對應的字串表示。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1309
msgid ""
"The *level* parameter also accepts a string representation of the level such "
"as 'INFO'. In such cases, this functions returns the corresponding numeric "
"value of the level."
msgstr ""
"*level* 參數也接受等級的字串表示，例如 'INFO'。在這種情況下，此函式會回傳該等"
"級對應的數值。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1313
msgid ""
"If no matching numeric or string value is passed in, the string 'Level %s' % "
"level is returned."
msgstr "如果傳入的數值或字串沒有相符的等級，則會回傳字串 'Level %s' % level。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1316
msgid ""
"Levels are internally integers (as they need to be compared in the logging "
"logic). This function is used to convert between an integer level and the "
"level name displayed in the formatted log output by means of the ``%"
"(levelname)s`` format specifier (see :ref:`logrecord-attributes`), and vice "
"versa."
msgstr ""
"等級在內部是整數（因為在日誌記錄邏輯中需要比較它們）。此函式用於在整數等級與"
"格式化日誌輸出中透過 ``%(levelname)s`` 格式說明符（請參閱 :ref:`logrecord-"
"attributes`）顯示的等級名稱之間互相轉換。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1322
msgid ""
"In Python versions earlier than 3.4, this function could also be passed a "
"text level, and would return the corresponding numeric value of the level. "
"This undocumented behaviour was considered a mistake, and was removed in "
"Python 3.4, but reinstated in 3.4.2 in order to retain backward "
"compatibility."
msgstr ""
"在 Python 3.4 之前的版本中，也可以傳入文字等級給此函式，它會回傳該等級對應的"
"數值。這個未記錄於文件中的行為被認為是個錯誤，並在 Python 3.4 中移除，但為了"
"保持向後相容性，又在 3.4.2 中恢復。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1330
msgid ""
"Returns a handler with the specified *name*, or ``None`` if there is no "
"handler with that name."
msgstr "回傳具有指定 *name* 的處理器；若沒有該名稱的處理器，則回傳 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1337
msgid "Returns an immutable set of all known handler names."
msgstr "回傳所有已知處理器名稱的不可變集合。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1343
msgid ""
"Creates and returns a new :class:`LogRecord` instance whose attributes are "
"defined by *attrdict*. This function is useful for taking a "
"pickled :class:`LogRecord` attribute dictionary, sent over a socket, and "
"reconstituting it as a :class:`LogRecord` instance at the receiving end."
msgstr ""
"建立並回傳一個新的 :class:`LogRecord` 實例，其屬性由 *attrdict* 定義。此函式"
"可用於將透過 socket 傳送、經 pickle 的 :class:`LogRecord` 屬性字典，在接收端"
"重建為 :class:`LogRecord` 實例。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1351
msgid ""
"Does basic configuration for the logging system by either creating "
"a :class:`StreamHandler` with a default :class:`Formatter` or using the  "
"given *formatter* instance, and adding it to the root logger. The "
"functions :func:`debug`, :func:`info`, :func:`warning`, :func:`error` "
"and :func:`critical` will call :func:`basicConfig` automatically if no "
"handlers are defined for the root logger."
msgstr ""
"為日誌記錄系統進行基本設定：建立一個使用預設 :class:`Formatter` 或給定 "
"*formatter* 實例的 :class:`StreamHandler`，並將其加入根記錄器。如果根記錄器沒"
"有定義任何處理器，函"
"式 :func:`debug`、:func:`info`、:func:`warning`、:func:`error` "
"和 :func:`critical` 會自動呼叫 :func:`basicConfig`。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1358
msgid ""
"This function does nothing if the root logger already has handlers "
"configured, unless the keyword argument *force* is set to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"如果根記錄器已經設定了處理器，此函式就不會做任何事，除非關鍵字引數 *force* 被"
"設為 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1361
msgid ""
"This function should be called from the main thread before other threads are "
"started. In versions of Python prior to 2.7.1 and 3.2, if this function is "
"called from multiple threads, it is possible (in rare circumstances) that a "
"handler will be added to the root logger more than once, leading to "
"unexpected results such as messages being duplicated in the log."
msgstr ""
"此函式應在其他執行緒啟動之前，從主執行緒呼叫。在 Python 2.7.1 和 3.2 之前的版"
"本中，如果從多個執行緒呼叫此函式，可能會（在少數情況下）將處理器多次加入根記"
"錄器，導致非預期的結果，例如日誌中出現重複的訊息。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1368
msgid "The following keyword arguments are supported."
msgstr "支援以下的關鍵字引數。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1375
msgid "*filename*"
msgstr "*filename*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1375
msgid ""
"Specifies that a :class:`FileHandler` be created, using the specified "
"filename, rather than a :class:`StreamHandler`."
msgstr ""
"指定要以給定的檔案名稱建立 :class:`FileHandler`，而不"
"是 :class:`StreamHandler`。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1379
msgid "*filemode*"
msgstr "*filemode*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1379
msgid ""
"If *filename* is specified, open the file in this :ref:`mode <filemodes>`. "
"Defaults to ``'a'``."
msgstr ""
"如果有指定 *filename*，就以此\\ :ref:`模式 <filemodes>`\\ 開啟檔案。預設為 "
"``'a'``。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1383
msgid "*format*"
msgstr "*format*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1383
msgid ""
"Use the specified format string for the handler. Defaults to attributes "
"``levelname``, ``name`` and ``message`` separated by colons."
msgstr ""
"為處理器使用指定的格式字串。預設為以冒號分隔的 ``levelname``、``name`` 和 "
"``message`` 屬性。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1388
msgid "*datefmt*"
msgstr "*datefmt*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1388
msgid ""
"Use the specified date/time format, as accepted by :func:`time.strftime`."
msgstr "使用指定的日期／時間格式，格式須為 :func:`time.strftime` 所接受。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1391
msgid "*style*"
msgstr "*style*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1391
msgid ""
"If *format* is specified, use this style for the format string. One of "
"``'%'``, ``'{'`` or ``'$'`` for :ref:`printf-style <old-string-"
"formatting>`, :meth:`str.format` or :class:`string.Template` respectively. "
"Defaults to ``'%'``."
msgstr ""
"如果有指定 *format*，就對格式字串使用此樣式。值為 ``'%'``、``'{'`` 或 "
"``'$'`` 其中之一，分別對應 :ref:`printf 風格 <old-string-"
"formatting>`、:meth:`str.format` 或 :class:`string.Template`。預設為 "
"``'%'``。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1399
msgid "*level*"
msgstr "*level*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1399
msgid "Set the root logger level to the specified :ref:`level <levels>`."
msgstr "將根記錄器的等級設為指定的\\ :ref:`等級 <levels>`。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1402
msgid "*stream*"
msgstr "*stream*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1402
msgid ""
"Use the specified stream to initialize the :class:`StreamHandler`. Note that "
"this argument is incompatible with *filename* - if both are present, a "
"``ValueError`` is raised."
msgstr ""
"使用指定的串流來初始化 :class:`StreamHandler`。請注意，此引數與 *filename* 不"
"相容，如果兩者同時存在，就會引發 ``ValueError``。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1408
msgid "*handlers*"
msgstr "*handlers*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1408
msgid ""
"If specified, this should be an iterable of already created handlers to add "
"to the root logger. Any handlers which don't already have a formatter set "
"will be assigned the default formatter created in this function. Note that "
"this argument is incompatible with *filename* or *stream* - if both are "
"present, a ``ValueError`` is raised."
msgstr ""
"如果有指定，這應該是一個由已建立的處理器所組成的可疊代物件，這些處理器將被加"
"入根記錄器。尚未設定格式化器的處理器都會被指派此函式中建立的預設格式化器。請"
"注意，此引數與 *filename* 或 *stream* 不相容，如果兩者同時存在，就會引發 "
"``ValueError``。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1417
msgid "*force*"
msgstr "*force*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1417
msgid ""
"If this keyword argument is specified as true, any existing handlers "
"attached to the root logger are removed and closed, before carrying out the "
"configuration as specified by the other arguments."
msgstr ""
"如果此關鍵字引數被指定為 true，則在依照其他引數進行設定之前，會先移除並關閉所"
"有附加在根記錄器上的現有處理器。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1423
msgid "*encoding*"
msgstr "*encoding*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1423
msgid ""
"If this keyword argument is specified along with *filename*, its value is "
"used when the :class:`FileHandler` is created, and thus used when opening "
"the output file."
msgstr ""
"如果此關鍵字引數與 *filename* 一起指定，則會在建立 :class:`FileHandler` 時使"
"用其值，因此也會在開啟輸出檔案時使用。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1428
msgid "*errors*"
msgstr "*errors*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1428
msgid ""
"If this keyword argument is specified along with *filename*, its value is "
"used when the :class:`FileHandler` is created, and thus used when opening "
"the output file. If not specified, the value 'backslashreplace' is used. "
"Note that if ``None`` is specified, it will be passed as such "
"to :func:`open`, which means that it will be treated the same as passing "
"'errors'."
msgstr ""
"如果此關鍵字引數與 *filename* 一起指定，則會在建立 :class:`FileHandler` 時使"
"用其值，因此也會在開啟輸出檔案時使用。若未指定，則會使用值 "
"'backslashreplace'。請注意，如果指定為 ``None``，它會被原封不動地傳"
"給 :func:`open`，這表示它會被視為與傳入 'errors' 相同。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1438
msgid "*formatter*"
msgstr "*formatter*"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1438
msgid ""
"If specified, set this formatter instance (see :ref:`formatter-objects`) for "
"all involved handlers. If not specified, the default is to create and use an "
"instance of :class:`logging.Formatter` based on arguments *format*, "
"*datefmt* and *style*. When *formatter* is specified together with any of "
"the three arguments *format*, *datefmt* and *style*, a ``ValueError`` is "
"raised to signal that these arguments would lose meaning otherwise."
msgstr ""
"如果有指定，就為所有相關的處理器設定此格式化器實例（請參閱 :ref:`formatter-"
"objects`）。若未指定，預設會根據引數 *format*、*datefmt* 和 *style* 建立並使"
"用一個 :class:`logging.Formatter` 實例。當 *formatter* 與 *format*、"
"*datefmt*、*style* 這三個引數中的任何一個一起指定時，會引發 ``ValueError``，"
"以表明這些引數在此情況下將失去意義。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1452
msgid "The *style* argument was added."
msgstr "新增 *style* 引數。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1455
msgid ""
"The *handlers* argument was added. Additional checks were added to catch "
"situations where incompatible arguments are specified (e.g. *handlers* "
"together with *stream* or *filename*, or *stream* together with *filename*)."
msgstr ""
"新增 *handlers* 引數。新增了額外的檢查，以捕捉指定了不相容引數的情況（例如 "
"*handlers* 與 *stream* 或 *filename* 一起指定，或 *stream* 與 *filename* 一起"
"指定）。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1461
msgid "The *force* argument was added."
msgstr "新增 *force* 引數。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1464
msgid "The *encoding* and *errors* arguments were added."
msgstr "新增 *encoding* 與 *errors* 引數。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1467
msgid "The *formatter* argument was added."
msgstr "新增 *formatter* 引數。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1472
msgid ""
"Informs the logging system to perform an orderly shutdown by flushing and "
"closing all handlers. This should be called at application exit and no "
"further use of the logging system should be made after this call."
msgstr ""
"通知日誌記錄系統排清並關閉所有處理器，以進行有序的關閉。此函式應在應用程式結"
"束時呼叫，且在此呼叫之後不應再使用日誌記錄系統。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1476
msgid ""
"When the logging module is imported, it registers this function as an exit "
"handler (see :mod:`atexit`), so normally there's no need to do that manually."
msgstr ""
"logging 模組被引入時，會將此函式註冊為結束處理函式（請參閱 :mod:`atexit`），"
"因此通常不需要手動進行。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1483
msgid ""
"Tells the logging system to use the class *klass* when instantiating a "
"logger. The class should define :meth:`!__init__` such that only a name "
"argument is required, and the :meth:`!__init__` should call :meth:`!"
"Logger.__init__`. This function is typically called before any loggers are "
"instantiated by applications which need to use custom logger behavior. After "
"this call, as at any other time, do not instantiate loggers directly using "
"the subclass: continue to use the :func:`logging.getLogger` API to get your "
"loggers."
msgstr ""
"告訴日誌記錄系統在實例化記錄器時使用類別 *klass*。該類別應定義 :meth:`!"
"__init__`，使其只需要一個名稱引數，而且該 :meth:`!__init__` 應呼叫 :meth:`!"
"Logger.__init__`。需要使用自訂記錄器行為的應用程式，通常會在實例化任何記錄器"
"之前呼叫此函式。在此呼叫之後，和其他任何時候一樣，不要直接使用子類別來實例化"
"記錄器：請繼續使用 :func:`logging.getLogger` API 來取得記錄器。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1494
msgid "Set a callable which is used to create a :class:`LogRecord`."
msgstr "設定一個用來建立 :class:`LogRecord` 的可呼叫物件。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1496
msgid "The factory callable to be used to instantiate a log record."
msgstr "用來實例化日誌紀錄的工廠可呼叫物件。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1498
msgid ""
"This function has been provided, along with :func:`getLogRecordFactory`, to "
"allow developers more control over how the :class:`LogRecord` representing a "
"logging event is constructed."
msgstr ""
"提供此函式（以及 :func:`getLogRecordFactory`）是為了讓開發者能更進一步控制代"
"表日誌事件的 :class:`LogRecord` 是如何被建構的。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1503
msgid "The factory has the following signature:"
msgstr "工廠具有以下簽名："

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1505
msgid ""
"``factory(name, level, fn, lno, msg, args, exc_info, func=None, sinfo=None, "
"**kwargs)``"
msgstr ""
"``factory(name, level, fn, lno, msg, args, exc_info, func=None, sinfo=None, "
"**kwargs)``"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1507
msgid "The logger name."
msgstr "記錄器名稱。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:0
msgid "level"
msgstr "level"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1508
msgid "The logging level (numeric)."
msgstr "日誌等級（數值）。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:0
msgid "fn"
msgstr "fn"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1509
msgid "The full pathname of the file where the logging call was made."
msgstr "進行日誌記錄呼叫之檔案的完整路徑名稱。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:0
msgid "lno"
msgstr "lno"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1510
msgid "The line number in the file where the logging call was made."
msgstr "檔案中進行日誌記錄呼叫的列號。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1511
msgid "The logging message."
msgstr "日誌訊息。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1512
msgid "The arguments for the logging message."
msgstr "日誌訊息的引數。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1513
msgid "An exception tuple, or ``None``."
msgstr "一個例外元組，或 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:0
msgid "func"
msgstr "func"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1514
msgid "The name of the function or method which invoked the logging call."
msgstr "發起日誌記錄呼叫的函式或方法名稱。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:0
msgid "sinfo"
msgstr "sinfo"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1516
msgid ""
"A stack traceback such as is provided by :func:`traceback.print_stack`, "
"showing the call hierarchy."
msgstr "像 :func:`traceback.print_stack` 所提供的堆疊回溯，顯示呼叫階層。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:0
msgid "kwargs"
msgstr "kwargs"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1518
msgid "Additional keyword arguments."
msgstr "額外的關鍵字引數。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1522
msgid "Module-Level Attributes"
msgstr "模組層級屬性"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1526
msgid ""
"A \"handler of last resort\" is available through this attribute. This is "
"a :class:`StreamHandler` writing to ``sys.stderr`` with a level of "
"``WARNING``, and is used to handle logging events in the absence of any "
"logging configuration. The end result is to just print the message to "
"``sys.stderr``. This replaces the earlier error message saying that \"no "
"handlers could be found for logger XYZ\". If you need the earlier behaviour "
"for some reason, ``lastResort`` can be set to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"透過此屬性可以取得一個 \"handler of last resort\"（最後手段處理器）。這是一個"
"寫入 ``sys.stderr``、等級為 ``WARNING`` 的 :class:`StreamHandler`，用於在沒有"
"任何日誌設定時處理日誌事件。最終結果就是將訊息印到 ``sys.stderr``。這取代了先"
"前那個表示 \"no handlers could be found for logger XYZ\" 的錯誤訊息。如果你因"
"為某些原因需要先前的行為，可以將 ``lastResort`` 設為 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1538
msgid "Used to see if exceptions during handling should be propagated."
msgstr "用來判斷處理期間發生的例外是否應該被傳播。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1540
msgid "Default: ``True``."
msgstr "預設值：``True``。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1542
msgid ""
"If :data:`raiseExceptions` is ``False``, exceptions get silently ignored. "
"This is what is mostly wanted for a logging system - most users will not "
"care about errors in the logging system, they are more interested in "
"application errors."
msgstr ""
"如果 :data:`raiseExceptions` 為 ``False``，例外會被默默忽略。這通常正是日誌記"
"錄系統所需要的行為：大多數使用者不會在意日誌記錄系統中的錯誤，他們更關心的是"
"應用程式的錯誤。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1549
msgid "Integration with the warnings module"
msgstr "與 warnings 模組整合"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1551
msgid ""
"The :func:`captureWarnings` function can be used to integrate :mod:`!"
"logging` with the :mod:`warnings` module."
msgstr ""
":func:`captureWarnings` 函式可用來將 :mod:`!logging` 與 :mod:`warnings` 模組"
"整合。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1556
msgid ""
"This function is used to turn the capture of warnings by logging on and off."
msgstr "此函式用於開啟或關閉由 logging 擷取警告的功能。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1559
msgid ""
"If *capture* is ``True``, warnings issued by the :mod:`warnings` module will "
"be redirected to the logging system. Specifically, a warning will be "
"formatted using :func:`warnings.formatwarning` and the resulting string "
"logged to a logger named ``'py.warnings'`` with a severity "
"of :const:`WARNING`."
msgstr ""
"如果 *capture* 為 ``True``，由 :mod:`warnings` 模組發出的警告將被重新導向到日"
"誌記錄系統。具體來說，警告會使用 :func:`warnings.formatwarning` 格式化，並將"
"結果字串以 :const:`WARNING` 嚴重性記錄到名為 ``'py.warnings'`` 的記錄器。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1564
msgid ""
"If *capture* is ``False``, the redirection of warnings to the logging system "
"will stop, and warnings will be redirected to their original destinations "
"(i.e. those in effect before ``captureWarnings(True)`` was called)."
msgstr ""
"如果 *capture* 為 ``False``，將停止把警告重新導向到日誌記錄系統，警告會被重新"
"導向到其原本的目的地（即呼叫 ``captureWarnings(True)`` 之前生效的目的地）。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1571
msgid "Module :mod:`logging.config`"
msgstr ":mod:`logging.config` 模組"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1572
msgid "Configuration API for the logging module."
msgstr "logging 模組的設定 API。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1574
msgid "Module :mod:`logging.handlers`"
msgstr ":mod:`logging.handlers` 模組"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1575
msgid "Useful handlers included with the logging module."
msgstr "logging 模組內建的實用處理器。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1577
msgid ":pep:`282` - A Logging System"
msgstr ":pep:`282` - 日誌記錄系統"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1578
msgid ""
"The proposal which described this feature for inclusion in the Python "
"standard library."
msgstr "描述此功能並提出被包含於 Python 標準函式庫中的提案。"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1581
msgid ""
"`Original Python logging package <https://old.red-dove.com/"
"python_logging.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`原始的 Python logging 套件 <https://old.red-dove.com/python_logging.html>`_"

#: ../../library/logging.rst:1582
msgid ""
"This is the original source for the :mod:`!logging` package.  The version of "
"the package available from this site is suitable for use with Python 1.5.2, "
"2.1.x and 2.2.x, which do not include the :mod:`!logging` package in the "
"standard library."
msgstr ""
"這是 :mod:`!logging` 套件的原始來源。此網站提供的套件版本適用於 Python "
"1.5.2、2.1.x 和 2.2.x，這些版本的標準函式庫中並未包含 :mod:`!logging` 套件。"

